encoding  utf-8
survey HighDouk

###Inputs, add surveys here###
input 1/HighDouk1.th #Lower to upper entrance
input 2/HighDouk2.th #Upper entrance to termination


###Joins, connecting scraps on the surveys###
join S1@HighDouk2 S1@HighDouk1

###Equates, connecting points on surveys###
equate 79@HighDouk1 1@HighDouk2

###Map, to create overall map. Input individual survey maps to create the whole###
map plan -projection plan
  plan@HighDouk1
  break
  plan@HighDouk2
endmap 

endsurvey

